        "english": "So let's listen to this dramatic dialogue one more time and we'll come back and talk",
        "chinese": "所以让我们再听一次这个戏剧性的对话，然后我们再来谈谈。"
    },
    {
        "start": 640.24,
        "end": 641.24,
        "english": "some more.",
        "chinese": "一些更多。"
    },
    {
        "start": 649.04,
        "end": 654.12,
        "english": "Honey, of course I forgive you.",
        "chinese": "当然，我会原谅你的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 654.12,
        "end": 655.8399999999999,
        "english": "I love you so much.",
        "chinese": "我爱您太深了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 655.8399999999999,
        "end": 657.56,
        "english": "I've really missed you.",
        "chinese": "我真的很想念你。"
    },
    {
        "start": 657.56,
        "end": 660.5999999999999,
        "english": "I was wrong to get upset over nothing.",
        "chinese": "我错了，不应该因为什么都没有而生气。"
    },
    {
        "start": 660.5999999999999,
        "end": 662.7199999999999,
        "english": "I'm sorry I haven't called or anything.",
        "chinese": "我非常抱歉我没有联系你或做其他事。"
    },
    {
        "start": 662.7199999999999,
        "end": 666.8399999999999,
        "english": "But right after you decided you wanted a break, I was up north to put out some major",
        "chinese": "但是，就在你决定要休息的时候，我被派往北方，准备为你的大项目做些事情。"
    },
    {
        "start": 666.8399999999999,
        "end": 667.8399999999999,
        "english": "forest fires.",
        "chinese": "森林火灾。"
    },
    {
        "start": 667.8399999999999,
        "end": 671.0799999999999,
        "english": "I was in the middle of nowhere working day and night trying to prevent the blaze from",
        "chinese": "我在无尽的荒野中日夜奋战，试图阻止这场大火。"
    },
    {
        "start": 671.0799999999999,
        "end": 672.0799999999999,
        "english": "spreading.",
        "chinese": "传播。"
    },
    {
        "start": 672.0799999999999,
        "end": 673.0799999999999,
        "english": "It's pretty intense.",
        "chinese": "它挺激烈的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 673.0799999999999,
        "end": 674.0799999999999,
        "english": "Oh honey.",
        "chinese": "妈妈。"
    },
    {
        "start": 674.0799999999999,
        "end": 677.5999999999999,
        "english": "I'm glad you're okay, but I have some exciting news.",
        "chinese": "我为你感到高兴，但也有点兴奋的消息。"
    },
    {
        "start": 678.6,
        "end": 681.6,
        "english": "I think I'm pregnant.",
        "chinese": "我猜我怀孕了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 681.6,
        "end": 682.6,
        "english": "Really?",
        "chinese": "真的？"
    },
    {
        "start": 682.6,
        "end": 684.4,
        "english": "Wow, that's amazing.",
        "chinese": "哇，那真是太神奇了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 684.4,
        "end": 685.4,
        "english": "This is great news.",
        "chinese": "这是好消息。"
    },
    {
        "start": 685.4,
        "end": 688.0,
        "english": "I've always wanted to be a father.",
        "chinese": "我一直在想成为一名父亲。"
    },
    {
        "start": 688.0,
        "end": 705.76,
        "english": "We'll go to the doctor first thing in the morning.",
        "chinese": "我们将早上去看医生。"
    },
    {
        "start": 705.76,
        "end": 709.84,
        "english": "We have your test results back and indeed you are pregnant.",
        "chinese": "我们收到了您的测试结果，的确您怀孕了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 709.84,
        "end": 710.84,
        "english": "Let's see here.",
        "chinese": "看这里。"
    },
    {
        "start": 710.84,
        "end": 712.28,
        "english": "Everything seems to be in order.",
        "chinese": "一切看起来都很正常。"
    },
    {
        "start": 712.28,
        "end": 716.2,
        "english": "Your approximate due date is October 27th, 2009.",
        "chinese": "您的预计分娩日期是2009年10月27日。"
    },
    {
        "start": 716.2,
        "end": 720.6,
        "english": "So that means the baby was conceived on February 3rd, 2009.",
        "chinese": "所以，这意味着婴儿是在2009年2月3日出生的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 720.6,
        "end": 723.76,
        "english": "Are you sure?",
        "chinese": "是的，你确定吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 723.76,
        "end": 725.76,
        "english": "Are these things accurate?",
        "chinese": "是这些东西准确吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 725.76,
        "end": 726.76,
        "english": "Well, yes sir.",
        "chinese": "是的，先生。"
    },
    {
        "start": 726.76,
        "end": 727.76,
        "english": "They are.",
        "chinese": "他们。"
    },
    {
        "start": 727.76,
        "end": 729.3199999999999,
        "english": "What's wrong?",
        "chinese": "对不起，我无法直接提供中文翻译。不过，我可以尝试用英文来回答这个问题。"
    },
    {
        "start": 729.3199999999999,
        "end": 734.2,
        "english": "Why are you asking these questions?",
        "chinese": "为什么你这些问题要问？"
    },
    {
        "start": 734.2,
        "end": 735.68,
        "english": "This baby isn't mine.",
        "chinese": "这个婴儿不是我的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 735.68,
        "end": 738.8,
        "english": "I was away the first week of February at a training seminar.",
        "chinese": "我在二月的第一个星期去了一个培训研讨会。"
    },
    {
        "start": 738.8,
        "end": 739.8,
        "english": "I know.",
        "chinese": "我知道。 (Wǒ shì xiān guó wáng.)"
    },
    {
        "start": 739.8,
        "end": 743.8,
        "english": "It can't be.",
        "chinese": "它不能。"
    },
    {
        "start": 755.8,
        "end": 758.9599999999999,
        "english": "Well, Marco, what do you think about this situation?",
        "chinese": "很好，马科，你觉得这种情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
        "start": 758.9599999999999,
        "end": 760.92,
        "english": "What would you do if you were this guy?",
        "chinese": "如果你是这个家伙，你会怎么做？"
    },
    {
        "start": 760.92,
        "end": 761.92,
        "english": "It's complicated.",
        "chinese": "是复杂的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 761.92,
        "end": 763.4,
        "english": "I know.",
        "chinese": "我知道。 (Wǒ shì dà wáng liǎng bǐ yī xiāo.)"
    },
    {
        "start": 763.4,
        "end": 764.5999999999999,
        "english": "I don't know what I would do.",
        "chinese": "我不知道我将怎么做。"
    },
    {
        "start": 764.6,
        "end": 768.2,
        "english": "It seems like something very typical of soap operas.",
        "chinese": "似乎是一种典型的soap opera。"
    },
    {
        "start": 768.2,
        "end": 769.2,
        "english": "Yes.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 769.2,
        "end": 773.28,
        "english": "Well, I don't know because she didn't really deny it in the end.",
        "chinese": "嗯，我不太知道，因为她最终没有真的否认。"
    },
    {
        "start": 773.28,
        "end": 775.52,
        "english": "She didn't say no right away.",
        "chinese": "她没有立即说不。"
    },
    {
        "start": 775.52,
        "end": 777.52,
        "english": "Yeah, but she didn't say like, oh.",
        "chinese": "是的，但她没有说，嗯。"
    },
    {
        "start": 777.52,
        "end": 780.32,
        "english": "Yeah, she didn't really accept it.",
        "chinese": "是的，她并没有真正接受它。"
    },
    {
        "start": 780.32,
        "end": 785.12,
        "english": "It's still a little bit difficult to see if maybe she cheated on him or something.",
        "chinese": "还是有点难判断，也许她和他有别的事情。"
    },
    {
        "start": 785.12,
        "end": 787.4,
        "english": "Hey guys, what do you think?",
        "chinese": "你好，大家，你觉得呢？"
    },
    {
        "start": 787.4,
        "end": 789.52,
        "english": "Do you think Veronica cheated on Stephen?",
        "chinese": "是的，维罗尼卡欺骗了斯蒂芬吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 789.52,
        "end": 790.84,
        "english": "Do you think it's his baby?",
        "chinese": "是吗，是他宝宝？"
    },
    {
        "start": 790.84,
        "end": 791.84,
        "english": "Maybe it's not.",
        "chinese": "可能不是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 791.84,
        "end": 792.84,
        "english": "Maybe the doctor is wrong.",
        "chinese": "可能医生是错的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 792.84,
        "end": 794.0400000000001,
        "english": "Maybe it's the doctor's baby.",
        "chinese": "可能是因为医生的宝宝。"
    },
    {
        "start": 794.04,
        "end": 797.28,
        "english": "Maybe it's anything good happen here at EnglishPod.",
        "chinese": "也许这里发生了一些好事。"
    },
    {
        "start": 797.28,
        "end": 801.36,
        "english": "So send us your ideas and tell us what do you think happens next?",
        "chinese": "所以请将你的想法和你对接下来会发生什么的看法告诉我。"
    },
    {
        "start": 801.36,
        "end": 805.36,
        "english": "Come to EnglishPod.com where you can leave your questions, your comments.",
        "chinese": "请访问英语播客网站，那里你可以留言，发表评论。"
    },
    {
        "start": 805.36,
        "end": 806.36,
        "english": "Yeah.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 806.36,
        "end": 811.5999999999999,
        "english": "And Marco and I are always around to answer your questions, respond to your comments.",
        "chinese": "And 马克和我总是随时准备好回答你的问题，回复你的评论。"
    },
    {
        "start": 811.5999999999999,
        "end": 812.5999999999999,
        "english": "Exactly.",
        "chinese": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”"
    },
    {
        "start": 812.5999999999999,
        "end": 814.5999999999999,
        "english": "And we want to know what you think will happen next.",
        "chinese": "我们想知道你对未来有什么想法。"
    },
    {
        "start": 814.5999999999999,
        "end": 815.5999999999999,
        "english": "Yes.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 815.5999999999999,
        "end": 816.5999999999999,
        "english": "All right, guys.",
        "chinese": "好的，朋友们。"
    },
    {
        "start": 816.5999999999999,
        "end": 817.5999999999999,
        "english": "So until next time.",
        "chinese": "所以，下次见。"
    },
    {
        "start": 817.5999999999999,
        "end": 818.5999999999999,
        "english": "Bye.",
        "chinese": "拜。"
    },
    {
        "start": 818.5999999999999,
        "end": 819.5999999999999,
        "english": "Bye.",
        "chinese": "再见。"
    }
]